BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Korea Policy Forum: Reflections on ROK-US Relations Fireside Chat 
 with Ambassador Kang Kyung-wha — Washington\, DC
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261106T140000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261106T150000
DTSTAMP:20261030T055419Z
UID:028e1ffd502c48c4fafdf0ab9fd0@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Academic\,Washington\, DC\,United States
DESCRIPTION:H.E. Kang Kyung-wha\, Ambassador of the Republic of Korea to t
 he United States\, will join a fireside chat reflecting on the evolution a
 nd enduring significance of the ROK-US relationship. Drawing on her extens
 ive diplomatic experience\, she will share her perspectives on the allianc
 e’s strength and resilience\, the growing importance of South Korea’s 
 soft power\, and the broader ties connecting the two countries. The conver
 sation will explore how shared values\, cultural exchanges\, and people-to
 -people connections can help sustain and strengthen the partnership in a c
