 nger this time. Rachel Maddow is the Emmy Award and Murrow Award winning h
 ost of The Rachel Maddow Show on MS NOW\, as well as the New York Times be
 stselling author of Drift\, Blowout\, and Prequel\, and the New York Times
  bestselling coauthor of Bag Man. Maddow received a ba\nCategory: Lectures
