SUMMARY:Ada Film Collective presents Echi Di Ime (Tomorrow Is Pregnant) 
 — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261114T160000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261114T180000
DTSTAMP:20261030T055419Z
UID:3eeb22c12d374158d448145c5544@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Film + TV\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Ada Film Collective presents screenings and conversations arou
 nd three short indie films by Igbo diasporic women filmmakers. Ada Film Co
 llective is a collaborative film exhibition effort to extend the shelf-lif
 e of short films by Black diasporic women and gender-expansive people. We 
 know that shorts\, rather than features\, are often the most accessible fo
 rm of filmmaking for our communities. Recognizing the value of short films
 \, together\, we dreamed of how to take showcasing our work into our own h
 ands. Our inaugural event ECHI DI IME (Tomorrow Is Pregnant) is an evening
