 y talk will be hosted by Anne Collins Smith\, Chief Curator\, and will be 
 focused on works in the exhibition Danielle Mckinney: Shelter . This galle
 ry talk will take place at 12:30 PM on the museum’s second floor. When y
 ou arrive at the museum\, check in with the admissions desk to be directed
  to the gallery talk’s location. Free with museum admission. Louisiana r
 esidents receive free admission to NOMA every Wednesday\, courtesy of The 
 Helis Foundation’s Art for All Initiative.\nCategory: Talks &amp\; Tours
 \nOriginal listing: https://noma.org/event/gallery-talk-chief-curator-anne
 -collins-smith-on-danielle-mckinney-shelter/
